  "id": "beck-hopelessness-scale",
  "term": "Beck Hopelessness Scale",
  "definition": "The Beck Hopelessness Scale is a psychological rating scale used to assess a person’s level of hopelessness. In research and clinical contexts, it can be used alongside other mental health measures to compare hopelessness across groups or examine its relationship with distress and caregiver burden.",
